      {
       "section": "paragraph",
       "text": "As of 31 Oct 2026, the organisation employs 885 people (839.0 FTE), with 286 separations recorded over the prior 12 months driving a 29.6% attrition rate \u2014 15.9% of which was voluntary.",
       "ids": [
        "clean:audit"
       ]
      },
      {
       "section": "paragraph",
       "text": "Pay spread across departments and a high attrition rate are the two areas most deserving immediate attention.",
