       ]
      },
      {
       "section": "finding",
       "text": "The overall annual salary distribution is wide \u2014 from $19,100 to $217,100 \u2014 with a median of $69,300 and a mean of $76,006, and outliers have been flagged but kept in the data.",
       "ids": [
        "eda:Annual_Salary"
       ]
      },
      {
       "section": "finding",
       "text": "The dataset covers hire dates from 2015 to 2026 across 885 employees recorded in 1,770 rows, meaning each employee appears more than once (e.g. across role or status changes), so headcount should never be read from row counts.",
       "ids": [
        "clean:audit"
       ]
